<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-TOP TEN QUALIFIERS FOR IRL RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TOP TEN QUALIFIERS FOR IRL RACE.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten qualifiers for</p>
<p>Saturday's Walt Disney World 200 Indy Racing League race</p>
<p>(tabulate by driver, country, chassis, engine, time):</p>
<p>1. Tony Stewart (U.S.), G Force Oldsmobile, 21.685 seconds,</p>
<p>166.013 mph/267.165 kph</p>
<p>2. Arie Luyendyk (Netherlands), G Force Oldsmobile, 21.823</p>
<p>3. Buzz Calkins (U.S.), G Force Oldsmobile, 21.945</p>
<p>4. Scott Sharp (U.S.), Dallara Oldsmobile, 21.980</p>
<p>5. Eddie Cheever (U.S.), G Force Oldsmobile, 22.012</p>
<p>6. Scott Goodyear (Canada), G Force Oldsmobile, 22.041</p>
<p>7. Davey Hamilton (U.S.), Dallara Oldsmobile, 22.048</p>
<p>8. Jeff Ward (U.S.), G Force Oldsmobile, 22.132</p>
<p>9. Jim Guthrie (U.S), G Force Oldsmobile, 22.185</p>
<p>10. Fermin Velez (Spain), Dallara Oldsmobile, 22.272</p>
</text>
